# She's a Woman, intro (figure 56.1)
# Pollack types a count "1*2*3 4" over the last bar, where the syncopated V arrives; it is kept
# as a caption, since the stars (probably the offbeats) can't be lined up reliably.
#? Where in bar 8 the E lands (typed "- E"); it is played on beat 3 here. Pollack calls it syncopated.
key A

system
chords   | E{V} | - | D{IV} | - |

system
chords   | A{I} | - | - | - E{V} |
caption bar 8 counted 1*2*3 4
